    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        311,
        2227,
        2117,
        2411
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, the functions of the several agencies require space to permit the Administrations, Departments and Agencies to perform assigned missions effectively and economically, and",
